  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abatahunga Coffee Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 2,500 smallholder farmers of whom 600 are women...Project funds will be used to set up a fully-fledged central eco-friendly washing station for processing high quality specialty Robusta and Catimor coffees which fetch higher prices than dry natural coffees. Some of the funds will be used for various trainings, and technical and managerial support. .</narrative>
  </description>
